[71.978,"o","\r\n"]
[72.198,"o","Each one proposes a file for you to review rather than writing one, and each also prints its prompt (--print-prompt) if you would rather paste it into an assistant you already have. Guide: docs/llm-assisted-setup.md\r\n"]
